only task allowed to run the dedicated completion check, update canonical
bible/inventory records, and accept that manifest.

## Acceptance criteria

- All 48 existing QB-A card revisions have independently inspectable
  original-expression, provenance, and two-distinct-review evidence, or every
  remaining ineligible card has its exact pending or blocked reason retained.
- The four existing batches remain finite at 12 cards each and no unreviewed
  record can enter selection.
